    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d112">

                <pb facs="0178" n="118" xml:id="pg118"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Denby to Mr.
                            Olney</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-08-27"><hi rendition="#italic">August 27,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Consul had started Kutien under ray orders, with the consent of Chinese
                    Government and with escort furnished by them, before your cipher telegram 12 was
                    received, taking naval officer with him. Consul reports the examination
                    proceeding smoothly. Officials actively cooperating. Many convictions
                    secured.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Denby</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
